B.aPQ=new A.hG(B.eA,"\ud83d\ude24","Cramps come from prostaglandins, the same chemicals that help your body heal. Frustrating team players.",null,null)
B.aPJ=new A.hG(B.eA,"\ud83d\ude04","Laughing releases endorphins, your body's own mild painkiller. Consider this card a tiny prescription.",null,null)
B.aPH=new A.hG(B.eA,"\ud83d\udca7","Drinking more water can mean less bloating: a hydrated body holds on to less. Bodies are wonderfully weird.",null,null)
B.aPO=new A.hG(B.eA,"\ud83c\udf4c","Bananas, dark chocolate and spinach are all rich in magnesium: the unofficial cramp-care squad.",null,null)
B.aPK=new A.hG(B.eA,"\ud83e\ude7a",'Doctors call your cycle a "fifth vital sign". By tracking it, you\'re keeping an eye on your whole health.',null,null)
B.aPM=new A.hG(B.eA,"\ud83c\udf19","Your body temperature rises slightly after ovulation and stays up until your period. You run a little warmer.",null,null)
B.aPL=new A.hG(B.eA,"\ud83e\udde0","Estrogen supports serotonin, the feel-good messenger. That's why mood can follow your cycle.",null,null)
