B.axp=new A.ah("How fast is emergency delivery?","Emergency orders go to the nearest partner store and a rider brings them to you. The estimated arrival time is shown before you pay and updates live while the order is on its way.")
B.awv=new A.ah("How do I track or cancel an order?","Open Profile \u2192 My orders. An order that is on its way opens live tracking. While an order can still be cancelled, its screen shows a Cancel option.")
B.awK=new A.ah("What is the 4-digit delivery code?","Give this code to the rider at your door. It proves the package reached you, so nobody else can collect it.")
B.alb=s([B.axp,B.awv,B.awK],t.Wy)
B.awC=new A.ah("Orders & delivery",B.alb)
B.awD=new A.ah("Who can read my messages?","Chats with friends are end-to-end encrypted: only you and the other person can read them, not PIAX. Calls go directly between the two phones and are encrypted too. Chats with the AI health assistant are not end-to-end encrypted, because the assistant has to read them to reply.")
B.axa=new A.ah("How do I start a chat with a friend?","Go to Chats \u2192 New message. Share your invite QR code or link, scan a friend's code, or verify your phone number to see which of your contacts use PIAX.")
B.awU=new A.ah("Why can't I call someone?",'Calls ring only while the other person has PIAX open. If they are offline you will see "Unavailable" and the missed call appears in your chat.')
B.adz=s([B.awD,B.axa,B.awU],t.Wy)
B.axl=new A.ah("Chats & calls",B.adz)
B.awN=new A.ah("Is my cycle data private?","Yes. Turn on Discreet mode in Profile \u2192 Privacy & your data to hide sensitive details on screen. From the same page you can copy or delete your data at any time.")
B.awS=new A.ah("What happens if I reinstall the app?","Your account is tied to this install. Reinstalling creates a new account, and encrypted chats from the old install can't be opened on the new one.")
B.agv=s([B.awN,B.awS],t.Wy)
B.awy=new A.ah("Your data & privacy",B.agv)
B.awO=new A.ah("Why am I not getting reminders?","Check Profile \u2192 Reminders, and make sure notifications for PIAX are allowed in your phone's settings.")
B.awQ=new A.ah("How do subscriptions work?","See Profile \u2192 Subscribe for the current plans, including Saver's Six, and what each one includes and costs.")
B.adn=s([B.awO,B.awQ],t.Wy)
B.axn=new A.ah("Reminders & subscriptions",B.adn)
